up on ram!  Put at LEAST 64 megs of ram in it if possible.  I originally
had 32 megs in it when I bought it and when I started X and Digital Unix's
Netscape it CRAWLED and swapped like mad.  I added 64 megs of ram to bring
it up to 96 and I've never dropped into swap again. :-)  The alphas (and
risc processors in general?) seem to be real memory hogs compared to the
x86's. 

